<title>USA: MSB Financial sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>MSB Financial sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MARSHALL, Mich. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>MSB Financial Inc, the holding company for Marshall Savings Bank FSB, said its board declared a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The split will be accomplished as a stock dividend payable on August 7 to stockholders of record July 22, MSBN said.</p>
<p>Stockholders will receive one share of common stock for each share they hold on the record date, MSB said.</p>
<p>Marshall Savings has two offices in Marshall, Mich.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
